WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.300
Temperatures in Latin America keep rising.

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:09.700
In 2024, we recorded the highest level
in our recent history.

3
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.200
Climate change is no longer
something distant.

4
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.800
It's on our streets,
under the same sun we all feel.

5
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:23.100
We know how to protect ourselves from the heat,
but not everyone can escape the sun.

6
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Workers, older adults, and children
are the ones who suffer the most.

7
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:34.400
Extreme heat can make us sick
or even take our lives.

8
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.900
In recent years,
heat-related deaths have doubled.

9
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.200
But we can adapt.

10
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:47.000
With nature-based solutions,
our cities can protect us from the heat.

11
00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:50.000
Heat doesn't hit us all equally.

12
00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:54.500
That's why we need cities that are
better designed and better prepared.
